# Bluey Theme Song (Joff Bush / Ludo Studio) -- main hook, simplified.
# Source transcription (letter notes): https://pianoletternotes.blogspot.com/2022/08/bluey-theme-song-ludo-studios-bluey.html
#   In that notation uppercase = sharp.  The right-hand melody opens with:
#     RH5: G-F-e-D-------C-----e---C-
#     RH5: eC----G-F-e-D-------C-----
#   i.e.  G#5 F#5 E5 D#5 ... C#5 ... E5 C#5   |   E5 C#5 G#5 F#5 E5 D#5 ... C#5
# Simplified to a single monophonic line (approximate; tune by ear).
name: Bluey Theme
tempo: 4
slots_per_beat: 2
melody:
    G#5/0.5 F#5/0.5 E5/0.5 D#5/1.5 R/1 C#5/1.5 E5/0.5 C#5/1.5
    E5/0.5 C#5/0.5 G#5/0.5 F#5/0.5 E5/0.5 D#5/1.5 R/1 C#5/1.5
